msgid "When \"one selected descriptor per group\" is chosen, at least one of a group's selcted descriptors must be present (OR) for every included group (AND); groups without selected descriptors are ignored. Not including sufficient descriptors can cause a lot of timers. So please always test this search before using it as search timer!"
